    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "We\u2019ll know by the end of tonight\u2026\n\n\nRick Scott (@ScottforFlorida)\n\nLet's see how much @VivekGRamaswamy beats these thresholds by! Make sure to go vote, Ohio!  He is running hard and will be a great Governor!\n\n\n\n\u2014 https://nitter.net/ScottforFlorida/status/2051779337767080181#m",
