      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "The mental health epidemic &amp; the normalization of violence are symptoms of a deeper problem. We\u2019re going to fix it in Ohio and show there\u2019s a better way.\n\nVideo",
